    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet parade in the solar system messes up your ship electronics and you have to emergency land on earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the middle of the Mobocalypse and you only have one friend who supports you with weapons and upgrades - R\u00fcdiger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a total of 5 different worlds with different enemies and a powerful boss in each world. Do you die in the process? No problem! A rift in the space-time continuum brings you back to R\u00fcdiger again and again - he can supply you with upgrades and new weapons in his shop that you can keep after you die. Every failed attempt makes you stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find a way to repair your spaceship and escape the Mobocalypse? Or is there perhaps even a way to stop the Mobocalypse and save planet Earth? And what does R\u00fcdiger's disappeared wife have to do with all that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet parade in the solar system messes up your ship electronics and you have to emergency land on earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the middle of the Mobocalypse and you only have one friend who supports you with weapons and upgrades - R\u00fcdiger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a total of 5 different worlds with different enemies and a powerful boss in each world. Do you die in the process? No problem! A rift in the space-time continuum brings you back to R\u00fcdiger again and again - he can supply you with upgrades and new weapons in his shop that you can keep after you die. Every failed attempt makes you stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find a way to repair your spaceship and escape the Mobocalypse? Or is there perhaps even a way to stop the Mobocalypse and save planet Earth? And what does R\u00fcdiger's disappeared wife have to do with all that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out!</p>",
    "short_description": "Mobocalypse is a shooter roguelite where you have to kill hordes of mobs to save the world - and youself!",
